            Node("decl-1", "Walk", "Walk", "A positive-length directed walk, with its direction explicit.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n\ninductive Walk {α : Type*} (r : α → α → Prop) : α → α → Prop\n  | one {a b} : r a b → Walk r a b\n  | cons {a b c} : r a b → Walk r b c → Walk r a c", DescribeRole.Definition),
            Node("decl-2", "Walk.trans", "Walk.trans", "The exact source contract below specifies D5.S3.Geometry.FiniteAcyclicFaceMatching.Walk.trans.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n\ntheorem trans {α : Type*} {r : α → α → Prop} {a b c : α}\n    (h : Walk r a b) (k : Walk r b c) : Walk r a c", DescribeRole.Theorem),
            Node("decl-3", "Walk.map", "Walk.map", "The exact source contract below specifies D5.S3.Geometry.FiniteAcyclicFaceMatching.Walk.map.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n\ntheorem map {α β : Type*} {r : α → α → Prop} {q : β → β → Prop}\n    (f : α → β) (hf : ∀ a b, r a b → q (f a) (f b))\n    {a b : α} (h : Walk r a b) : Walk q (f a) (f b)", DescribeRole.Theorem),
            Node("decl-4", "Acyclic", "Acyclic", "The exact source contract below specifies D5.S3.Geometry.FiniteAcyclicFaceMatching.Acyclic.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n\ndef Acyclic {α : Type*} (r : α → α → Prop) : Prop", DescribeRole.Definition),
            Node("decl-5", "finite_source", "finite_source", "Every nonempty induced finite subgraph of a DAG has an actual source. The minimizing statistic is the number of strict ancestors in the finite set. An incoming edge makes this ancestor set strictly smaller, not merely weakly smaller. No prechosen topological order is required.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n\ntheorem finite_source {α : Type*} [DecidableEq α] (F : Finset α)\n    (r : α → α → Prop) (ha : Acyclic r) (hne : F.Nonempty) :\n    ∃ s ∈ F, ∀ t ∈ F, ¬ r t s", DescribeRole.Theorem),
            Node("decl-6", "Cover", "Cover", "A cover adds exactly one ORIGINAL vertex.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n\ndef Cover (a b : Finset V) : Prop", DescribeRole.Definition),
            Node("decl-7", "upper", "upper", "The exact source contract below specifies D5.S3.Geometry.FiniteAcyclicFaceMatching.upper.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n\ndef upper (e : Finset V × V) : Finset V", DescribeRole.Definition),
            Node("decl-8", "Incident", "Incident", "The exact source contract below specifies D5.S3.Geometry.FiniteAcyclicFaceMatching.Incident.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n\ndef Incident (s : Finset V) (e : Finset V × V) : Prop", DescribeRole.Definition),
            Node("decl-9", "Pairing", "Pairing", "Only finite combinatorial data: disjoint actual codimension-one pairs. In particular this structure has no collapse, core, map, or SDR field.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n\nstructure Pairing (K : PreAbstractSimplicialComplex V) where\n  pairs : Finset (Finset V × V)\n  lower_nonempty : ∀ e ∈ pairs, e.1.Nonempty\n  apex_notMem : ∀ e ∈ pairs, e.2 ∉ e.1\n  upper_mem : ∀ e ∈ pairs, upper e ∈ K\n  disjoint : ∀ e ∈ pairs, ∀ f ∈ pairs, ∀ s,\n    Incident s e → Incident s f → e = f", DescribeRole.Definition),
            Node("decl-10", "Pairing.lower_mem", "Pairing.lower_mem", "The exact source contract below specifies D5.S3.Geometry.FiniteAcyclicFaceMatching.Pairing.lower_mem.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\nvariable {K : PreAbstractSimplicialComplex V} (M : Pairing K)\n\ntheorem lower_mem {e : Finset V × V} (he : e ∈ M.pairs) : e.1 ∈ K", DescribeRole.Theorem),
            Node("decl-11", "Pairing.lower_ne_upper", "Pairing.lower_ne_upper", "The exact source contract below specifies D5.S3.Geometry.FiniteAcyclicFaceMatching.Pairing.lower_ne_upper.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\nvariable {K : PreAbstractSimplicialComplex V} (M : Pairing K)\n\ntheorem lower_ne_upper {e : Finset V × V} (he : e ∈ M.pairs) :\n    e.1 ≠ upper e", DescribeRole.Theorem),
            Node("decl-12", "Pairing.Unmatched", "Pairing.Unmatched", "The exact source contract below specifies D5.S3.Geometry.FiniteAcyclicFaceMatching.Pairing.Unmatched.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\nvariable {K : PreAbstractSimplicialComplex V} (M : Pairing K)\n\ndef Unmatched (s : Finset V) : Prop", DescribeRole.Definition),
            Node("decl-13", "Pairing.Edge", "Pairing.Edge", "Matched covers point UP; every other cover points DOWN.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\nvariable {K : PreAbstractSimplicialComplex V} (M : Pairing K)\n\ndef Edge (a b : Finset V) : Prop", DescribeRole.Definition),
            Node("decl-14", "Pairing.IsAcyclic", "Pairing.IsAcyclic", "The exact source contract below specifies D5.S3.Geometry.FiniteAcyclicFaceMatching.Pairing.IsAcyclic.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\nvariable {K : PreAbstractSimplicialComplex V} (M : Pairing K)\n\ndef IsAcyclic : Prop", DescribeRole.Definition),
            Node("decl-15", "Pairing.Saturated", "Pairing.Saturated", "The exact source contract below specifies D5.S3.Geometry.FiniteAcyclicFaceMatching.Pairing.Saturated.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\nvariable {K : PreAbstractSimplicialComplex V} (M : Pairing K)\n\ndef Saturated (L : PreAbstractSimplicialComplex V) : Prop", DescribeRole.Definition),
            Node("decl-16", "Pairing.saturated_self", "Pairing.saturated_self", "The exact source contract below specifies D5.S3.Geometry.FiniteAcyclicFaceMatching.Pairing.saturated_self.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\nvariable {K : PreAbstractSimplicialComplex V} (M : Pairing K)\n\ntheorem saturated_self : M.Saturated K", DescribeRole.Theorem),
            Node("decl-17", "Pairing.upper_edge", "Pairing.upper_edge", "The exact source contract below specifies D5.S3.Geometry.FiniteAcyclicFaceMatching.Pairing.upper_edge.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\nvariable {K : PreAbstractSimplicialComplex V} (M : Pairing K)\n\ntheorem upper_edge {e : Finset V × V} (he : e ∈ M.pairs) :\n    M.Edge e.1 (upper e)", DescribeRole.Theorem),
            Node("decl-18", "Pairing.source_lower", "Pairing.source_lower", "A source outside a saturated target must be a LOWER of a matching pair. The conclusion includes the actual source assertion in the finite difference.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\nvariable {K : PreAbstractSimplicialComplex V} (M : Pairing K)\n\ntheorem source_lower (hacyc : M.IsAcyclic)\n    {L T : PreAbstractSimplicialComplex V} (hLK : L ≤ K) (hTL : T ≤ L)\n    (hL : M.Saturated L) (hT : M.Saturated T)\n    (hcrit : ∀ s ∈ L, M.Unmatched s → s ∈ T)\n    (hne : L ≠ T) :\n    ∃ e ∈ M.pairs, e.1 ∈ L ∧ e.1 ∉ T ∧\n      ∀ s ∈ L, s ∉ T → ¬ M.Edge s e.1", DescribeRole.Theorem),
            Node("decl-19", "Pairing.source_free", "Pairing.source_free", "The source condition proves freeness in the WHOLE current complex. For every vertex of a strict coface outside the lower, its immediate coface would point down into the source unless it is the designated upper. This also rules out every coface of higher codimension.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\nvariable {K : PreAbstractSimplicialComplex V} (M : Pairing K)\n\ntheorem source_free {L T : PreAbstractSimplicialComplex V}\n    (hLK : L ≤ K) (hTL : T ≤ L) (e : Finset V × V) (he : e ∈ M.pairs)\n    (hlL : e.1 ∈ L) (hlT : e.1 ∉ T)\n    (hsource : ∀ s ∈ L, s ∉ T → ¬ M.Edge s e.1) :\n    ∀ t ∈ L, e.1 ⊂ t → t = upper e", DescribeRole.Theorem),
            Node("decl-20", "Pairing.sourcePair", "Pairing.sourcePair", "Construct the native owner pair; no new pair or sequence owner is defined.", "Source variable context (not a compiled telescope):\nvariable {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\nvariable {K : PreAbstractSimplicialComplex V} (M : Pairing K)\n\ndef sourcePair {L T : PreAbstractSimplicialComplex V} (hLK : L ≤ K)\n    (hTL : T ≤ L) (hL : M.Saturated L) (e : Finset V × V)\n    (he : e ∈ M.pairs) (hlL : e.1 ∈ L) (hlT : e.1 ∉ T)\n    (hs : ∀ s ∈ L, s ∉ T → ¬ M.Edge s e.1) : CollapsePair V", DescribeRole.Definition))));

